
[00:03.11]Crickets play their evening song
[00:07.87]Chirping loudly all night long
[00:09.93]Rubbing wings and open wide
[00:12.28]Chirping for their lovely bride
[00:16.18]When night comes
[00:17.66]They play their tune
[00:18.37]Chirping by the silver moon
[00:19.91]At the campfire
[00:21.30]Hear their roar
[00:22.25]Silence and they sing no more

